and I hadn't seen him in months

00:52:45.280 --> 00:52:51.440
and when we got on the Zoom he got on and he

00:52:51.440 --> 00:52:54.800
you know at first it was pretty comical because he hadn't cut his hair in a

00:52:54.800 --> 00:52:58.480
long time and his beard was very he looked like he hadn't showered in a while

00:52:58.480 --> 00:53:02.400
and I was like what's going on and then when he said salams to me he

00:53:02.400 --> 00:53:09.200
just started crying so much Oh, and people didn't know what to do on the Zoom.

00:53:09.200 --> 00:53:13.599
