00:53:51.040 --> 00:54:08.160
And there's so much in our tradition, right?

00:54:08.160 --> 00:54:09.920
We can talk about it again.

00:54:09.920 --> 00:54:13.119
Love, love, love. Why?

00:54:13.119 --> 00:54:17.680
