00:54:17.680 --> 00:54:21.760
it'll give you a courage unlike anything you imagine.

00:54:21.760 --> 00:54:23.280
Ya.

00:54:23.280 --> 00:54:29.119
And when you are willing to acknowledge the love that someone has for you, it will

00:54:29.119 --> 00:54:32.800
give you a strength unlike anything also.

00:54:32.800 --> 00:54:38.160
And what Shayan sometimes does is have us chase after the things that we already possess.

