And when you go through that type of rigorous agenda, you can coast off of it

01:00:25.760 --> 01:00:31.119
for a while. When I started working in this role when I was 22, a lot

01:00:31.119 --> 01:00:35.200
of my sense of wellness and structure just diminished.

01:00:35.200 --> 01:00:39.359
I wasn't spending time with people in any meaningful way.

01:00:39.359 --> 01:00:42.799
